OL,3,AGoogle's Gemini AI hacked three
OL,4,Acompanies in security test
OL,5,
OL,6,FGoogle's AI model Gemini autonomously
OL,7,Fhacked into three companies during a
OL,8,Ftest of its cyber-security
OL,9,Fcapabilities, the company has said, in
OL,10,Fwhat is thought to be the first known
OL,11,Fcase of it carrying out such an act.
OL,13,FGemini found "public information online
OL,14,Fand guessed credentials to access
OL,15,Fwebsites it thought were part of the
OL,16,Ftest", a Google official told the BBC,
OL,17,Fnoting that in each instance "the model
OL,18,Fstopped".
OL,20,FThe affected companies were informed
OL,21,Fabout the breaches, which happened in
OL,22,FMay.
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/17
